      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your 'Environmental Impact' section, aiming for genuine integration while subtly including the target keywords:\n\nTitan Industrial is committed to responsible operational growth, even as our energy consumption rose 4% with the new facility. We prioritized waste reduction by implementing a digital filing system, a key step towards a more **green** administrative footprint. Moving forward, we are actively exploring options to transition our current diesel fleet toward more **sustainable** power sources for our logistics network. Furthermore, our comprehensive water management upheld a usage baseline of 500,000 gallons this year.",
